#. Key:	BriefingSayKartsSolo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(888)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(888)
